# Cloud saves + sign-in (optional). Copy to .env.local for `npm run dev`; leave unset and the game runs
# exactly as before (no accounts, progress in localStorage only). See supabase/README.md and docs/CLOUD.md.
#
# Project URL and anon (public) key: Supabase dashboard > Project Settings > API.
# The anon key is meant to ship in the browser; row level security keeps every user to their own row.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
